at her 3x in a row for the achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press spacebar to count when it\u2019s your turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included with your purchase:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple but perplexing arithmetic challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single button gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spoken dialog with subtitles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The numbers 1 through 21</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An annoying girl (ft Layla)\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DLC and extras:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've enjoyed counting with Layla, there are some optional donation DLCs available which allow you to take Layla to new locations.</p>","developers":["&y"],"dlc":[4011320,4011330,4011340,4011350,4011360,4011370,4011380,4011390,4011400,4011410,4011470],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951700/10b49c82625c55f1431872db0481b472d4585cdb/header.jpg?t=1758403985","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951700/764800197/e17efb56884af1bf56e9a739ad7455895c4ae40e/1757020037/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757021485","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951700/764800197/e17efb56884af1bf56e9a739ad7455895c4ae40e/1757020037/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757021485","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3951700/764800197/e17efb56884af1bf56e9a739ad7455895c4ae40e/1757020037/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757021485","id":257193312,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.aka